# Tomoe installer
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Instala e configura Umbriel + Noctalia + Noctalia Greeter em CachyOS/Arch.
# Uso: ./tomoe install [--dry-run] [--yes] [--reboot]
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

